  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"824\">\n<p data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"710\"><strong data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"656\">High Adiponectin</strong> levels are generally <strong data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"692\">protective</strong>, associated with:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"824\">\n<li data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"787\">\n<p data-start=\"715\" data-end=\"787\">Reduced risk of <strong data-start=\"731\" data-end=\"750\">type 2 diabetes</strong>, <strong data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"763\">obesity</strong>, <strong data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"787\">metabolic syndrome</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"824\">\n<p data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"824\">Improved <strong data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"824\">insulin sensitivity</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"992\">\n<p data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"867\"><strong data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"847\">Low Adiponectin</strong> levels are seen in:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"992\">\n<li data-start=\"870\" data-end=\"883\">\n<p data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"883\"><strong data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"883\">Obesity</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"886\" data-end=\"910\">\n<p data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"910\"><strong data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"910\">Insulin resistance</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"913\" data-end=\"943\">\n<p data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"943\"><strong data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"943\">Type 2 Diabetes Mellitus</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"992\">\n<p data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"992\"><strong data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"971\">Cardiovascular risk</strong> and <strong data-start=\"976\" data-end=\"992\">hypertension</strong></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
